function renderDaily(){const p=State.profile||{};const streak=Number(p.streak||0);setText('dailyStreakNum',streak);setText('dailyBonusMult',streak>=7?'x2.0':streak>=4?'x1.5':'x1.0');const g=el('dailyGrid');if(g)g.innerHTML=DAILY_PLAN.map((r,i)=>`<div class="daily-day ${((streak%7)||7)===(i+1)?'current':''}"><b>Day ${i+1}</b><span>+${fmt(r)}</span></div>`).join('');setStateButton('dailyClaimBtn',p.lastClaimDate===todayKey(),'Claimed today','Claim today');setStateButton('spinWheelBtn',p.wheelSpunDate===todayKey(),'Spun today','Spin the wheel');setStateText('scratchStatus',p.scratchDate===todayKey()?'Used today':'Tap the card to claim today');setStateText('mysteryStatus',p.mysteryDate===todayKey()?'Opened today':'Tap the box to claim today');setStateText('treasureStatus',p.treasureDate===todayKey()?'Opened today':'Tap the chest to claim today');}
